{"4210370": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Guardians Planetfall", "steam_appid": 4210370, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Guardians Planetfall – Join the Galactic War</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the creators of <strong>Guardians Frontline</strong>, Guardians Planetfall drops you into a galaxy-wide war for the fate of humanity. Fight assembled into squads of up to 4 soldiers in <strong>fast, tactical VR combat across dangerous planets and space installations</strong> filled with hostile aliens, Void soldiers, and massive war machines</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4210370/extras/e831a1b8156a15a0d8afc99cdec6f537.poster.avif?t=1778251842\" width=1170 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4210370/extras/e831a1b8156a15a0d8afc99cdec6f537.webm?t=1778251842\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4210370/extras/e831a1b8156a15a0d8afc99cdec6f537.mp4?t=1778251842\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drop onto hostile worlds</strong> and fight across jungles, frozen tundras, volcanic plains, alien deserts, and derelict space stations. Every biome features unique hazards, day-night cycles, partial destruction and procedural layouts that make each mission unpredictable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4210370/extras/d37207f246a9fd85b4fc3fde2992f9a5.poster.avif?t=1778251842\" width=1170 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4210370/extras/d37207f246a9fd85b4fc3fde2992f9a5.webm?t=1778251842\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4210370/extras/d37207f246a9fd85b4fc3fde2992f9a5.mp4?t=1778251842\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize your loadout and grow stronger</strong> with advanced weapons, specialized suits, and powerful ship-deployed stratagems. Gather resources, craft consumables, and upgrade your gear with rare blueprints.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4210370/extras/e20ac2b6c23bc06c58727678d159177b.poster.avif?t=1778251842\" width=1170 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4210370/extras/e20ac2b6c23bc06c58727678d159177b.webm?t=1778251842\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4210370/extras/e20ac2b6c23bc06c58727678d159177b.mp4?t=1778251842\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Command and upgrade your spaceship</strong> as your mobile base and ultimate weapon. Research new systems, repair damage, and call down devastating fire support during missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4210370/extras/ead12b0c010b2b6996badb8ea3d0b41a.poster.avif?t=1778251842\" width=1170 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4210370/extras/ead12b0c010b2b6996badb8ea3d0b41a.webm?t=1778251842\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4210370/extras/ead12b0c010b2b6996badb8ea3d0b41a.mp4?t=1778251842\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Influence a living Galactic War</strong> where community actions shift planetary control. Liberate worlds, repel invasions, sabotage Void facilities, and help shape the fate of the entire galaxy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4210370/extras/3e9bf22d0f0672cd3055357e8fc29651.poster.avif?t=1778251842\" width=1170 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4210370/extras/3e9bf22d0f0672cd3055357e8fc29651.webm?t=1778251842\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4210370/extras/3e9bf22d0f0672cd3055357e8fc29651.mp4?t=1778251842\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your own missions</strong> with a powerful co-op editor that lets you sculpt terrain, place enemies, set objectives, and create full facilities or open-world maps. Publish your creations and see the best missions added directly into the Galactic War for everyone to play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Guardians Planetfall – Join the Galactic War</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the creators of <strong>Guardians Frontline</strong>, Guardians Planetfall drops you into a galaxy-wide war for the fate of humanity. Fight assembled into squads of up to 4 soldiers in <strong>fast, tactical VR combat across dangerous planets and space installations</strong> filled with hostile aliens, Void soldiers, and massive war machines</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted l